        "TileImage": "$($repository 7af86858-df9d-478b-b5d8-803379cd165f).Image",
        "Description": "Your targets today are Richard Wilson and his pal Thaddeus Rivero also known as River. They run a human trafficing and server robbing organisation. They do all kinds of experiments to innocent humans and recently stole 20 billion US dollars from our client. The only reason they can get away is because of the influence of Rivers father who is a known Politician. They need to be put down... Richard is hosting  a BBC party and this might be just the oppertunity you need...\r\rGood luck 47",
